 "note": "Top-floor counters (fix2 repaint 2026-10-22): cream stone walls over dark oak wainscot, green-and-cream chequered tiles; LANDMARK the big round stained-glass skylight. Stairs going DOWN at the left front (first-floor counters); the brass payment windows on the back counter are the zoom. Feminine LEFT: clerk checking a banknote with a magnifier (vérification), clerk sharing one coin into each tin beside a toy locomotive (allocation), famous notary sipping tea with two autograph-seekers (notoriété), mother pressing the payout machine's button as an envelope slides out (prestation). Masculine RIGHT: farmer signing for a loan beside his cart of prunes (emprunt), bumblebee by the brass tap gushing into a basin (débit), tutor in a tool belt guiding a boy at the push-button terminal (utilisateur), genie pouring out of an old television set (générique), salmon leaping up the wall fountain (contre-courant), miner chipping a gold-veined rock (gisement).",
